[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9300.15, "timestamp": "02:35:00", "text": "基本上就是向人们挥手致意。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9313.429, "timestamp": "02:35:13", "text": "你玩漂流多久了？哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9315.59, "timestamp": "02:35:15", "text": "是的。你快要结束了，对吧？你得到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9319.429, "timestamp": "02:35:19", "text": "解决这个问题。是的。这令人担忧。呃，不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9323.03, "timestamp": "02:35:23", "text": "太久了，大概两年吧。呃，但我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9324.87, "timestamp": "02:35:24", "text": "我断断续续地做着 YouTuber 的工作，因为我其实"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9326.469, "timestamp": "02:35:26", "text": "中等水平，大约有 30 种不同的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9328.79, "timestamp": "02:35:28", "text": "YouTube 用户。所以我通常不直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9330.71, "timestamp": "02:35:30", "text": "我通常担任主持人。事实上，我曾"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9332.71, "timestamp": "02:35:32", "text": "我右边这里有个屏幕"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9334.309, "timestamp": "02:35:34", "text": "实际上，是在照看别人的……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9337.67, "timestamp": "02:35:37", "text": "正在聊天。所以你看不见我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9341.11, "timestamp": "02:35:41", "text": "在流媒体上播放。是的。但我喜欢拥有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9344.389, "timestamp": "02:35:44", "text": "我本人也准备好了，如果他们需要帮忙的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9347.91, "timestamp": "02:35:47", "text": "问过吗？所以，如果我能帮到任何人，我都会尽力帮忙。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9349.51, "timestamp": "02:35:49", "text": "温和的意思是，“嘿，我想……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9351.03, "timestamp": "02:35:51", "text": "做这件事。你是怎么做到的？我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9352.79, "timestamp": "02:35:52", "text": "比如，“好的，你应该这样做。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9355.91, "timestamp": "02:35:55", "text": "因为我有经验。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9358.389, "timestamp": "02:35:58", "text": "然后，像这样，我就可以肯定地说："}]